    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-73",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.2.1. Understand the safety precautions to be followed before-, during-, and after-operation  of the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-74",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.2.2. Understand the purpose of the full-size van and its role in the mission. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-75",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.2.3. Know the proper operator maintenance procedures of the full-size van IAW applicable  technical orders (TO) and use of Air Force (AF) Form 1800, Operator’s Inspection Guide and  Trouble Report. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-76",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.2.4. Safely and proficiently operate the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-77",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.3. Lesson Duration. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-78",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.3.1. Recommended instructional and hands on training time is 3.25 hours: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-79",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Figure 3.1.  Recommended Training Time for Training Activities. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
