        {
          "id": "p-92",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Note:  This is a recommended time; training time may be more or less depending how quickly a  trainee learns new tasks. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-93",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.4. Instructional References. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-94",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.4.1. Risk Management (RM) and Safety Principles. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-95",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.4.2. Applicable TOs or Manufacturer’s Operator’s Manual (see vehicle maintenance for TO  number for vehicle being used in training). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-96",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.4.3. Air Force Manual (AFMAN) 24-306, Operation of Air Force Government Motor  Vehicles. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-97",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.4.4. AF Form 1800. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-98",
          "pageNumber": 5,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.5. Instructional Training Aids and Equipment. ",
            },
          ],
