    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-101",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.5.3. Applicable TO or manufacturer’s operators manual. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-102",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.5.4. AF Form 1800. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-103",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.5.5. Videos (if locally produced). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-104",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.5.6. Suitable training area. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-105",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "3.5.7. Traffic cones or suitable markers. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "h-4",
          "level": 1,
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Section 4—TRAINEE PREPARATION ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "heading",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-106",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.1. Licensing Requirements. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-107",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.1.1. Trainee must have in his/her possession a valid state driver’s license. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-108",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.1.2. AF Form 171, Request for Driver’s Training and Addition to U.S. Government Driver’s  License IAW Air Force Instruction (AFI) 24-301, Ground Transportation. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-109",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.1.3. Applicable local licensing jurisdiction requirements. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-110",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.2. Required Reading ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-111",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.2.1. Read Full-Size Van Operator Training Package. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-112",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.2.2. Read AFMAN 24-306. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-113",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "4.2.3. Read manufacturer’s operator’s manual for the vehicle being trained on. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "h-5",
          "level": 1,
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Section 5—KNOWLEDGE LECTURE AND EVALUATION ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "heading",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-114",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.1. Knowledge Overview (Lecture). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-115",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.1.1. A full-size van, large SUV, is a large-wheeled vehicle, intended to carry numerous  persons in addition to the vehicle operator.  The DAF uses a variety of different full-size vans  and large SUVs. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-116",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2. Overview of Training and Requirements. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-117",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.1. Training objectives: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-118",
          "pageNumber": 6,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.1.1. Given lectures, demonstrations, hands-on driving session and a performance test,  trainees will be able to perform operator’s inspection and complete the performance test  with zero instructor assists. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
      "pageNumber": 6,
