    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-119",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.1.2. Train and qualify each trainee in safe operation and preventive maintenance of  the various full-size vans and large SUVs. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-120",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.1.3. This training will ensure the trainee becomes a qualified full-size van operator— an operator who has the knowledge and skills to operate a full-size van in a safe and  professional manner. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-121",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2. Desired learning outcome: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-122",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.1. Understand the safety precautions to be followed before-, during-, and after-  operation of the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-123",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.2. Understand the purpose of the full-size van and its role in the mission. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-124",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.2.1.   Purpose is to transport personnel. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-125",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.2.2.   Role in the mission (Unit/Base/Community (during natural disasters)/AF). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-126",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.2.3.   Know the proper operator maintenance procedures of the full-size van, IAW  applicable technical orders and use of AF Form 1800. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-127",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.2.4.   Be able to safely and proficiently operate the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-128",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.2.4.1.  Meet mission requirements. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-129",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.2.2.4.2.  Demonstrates a qualified trained professional operator. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-130",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.3. Full-size van Specifications.  Full-size vans vary in size, shape and specifications,  determined by make and model; it is imperative to know the specifications of the full-size van  before operation.  Specification information should be used together to determine the proper  use and area in which the full-size van will be used.  This information is best found in the  appropriate TO or for quick reference, the information may be found on the vehicle data plate  located on the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-131",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.3.1. Height:  7’ ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-132",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.3.2. Width:  8’1’’ ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-133",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.3.3. Length:  19’10’’ ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-134",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.3.4. Fuel Type:  E-85. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-135",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.3.5. Fuel Capacity:  31 gallons. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-136",
          "pageNumber": 7,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.2.3.6. Passenger Capability:  15 passengers. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
      "pageNumber": 7,
