    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-176",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.1.19.  Windshield and windshield wipers/washers. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-177",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.1.20.  Doors. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-178",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.1.21.  Windows. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-179",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.1.22.  Hood latches. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-180",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.1.23.  Seatbelts. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-181",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.1.24.  Fire Extinguisher. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-182",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2. During-operation: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-183",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2.1.   All gauges and warning lights for proper operations. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-184",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2.1.1.  Warning lights. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-185",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2.1.2.  Gauges.  (Oil pressure, fuel gauge, water temperature, voltage). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-186",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2.1.3.  Indicators. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-187",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2.2.   Listen for exhaust and air leaks.  Listen for any unusual sounds. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-188",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2.3.   Stay alert for any unusual smells or odors. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-189",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.2.4.   Stay alert for any abnormal vibrations or handling problems. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-190",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.3. After-operation inspection. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-191",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.3.1.   Ensure the full-size van is cleaned (free of dirt, excess oil, and grease). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-192",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.3.2.   Refuel. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-193",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.3.2.1.  For all types of fuel and charging:  Use refueling area or charging area,  turn-off engine and use parking brake, and do not smoke or use electronic devices. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-194",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.1.4. Pre-trip vehicle inspection test.  Use Attachment 2 as a walk around guide along  with AF Form 1800. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-195",
          "pageNumber": 10,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.3.2. A Seven-Step Inspection Method will help ensure the inspection is the same each time  it is conducted, and that nothing is left out.  See Attachment 4 for the Seven-Step Inspection  Method. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
      "pageNumber": 10,
