    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-196",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4. Vehicle Safety and Equipment. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-197",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.1. Hazards and Human Factors. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-198",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.1.1. Common mishap types: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-199",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.1.1.1.   Blind spots. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-200",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.1.1.2.   Backing. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-201",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.1.1.3.   Clearance. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-202",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.1.1.4.   Rollovers. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-203",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.2. Safety clothing and equipment: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-204",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.2.1. Reflective belts/vests during operation of low visibility and on the flightline. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-205",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.2.2. Inclement weather gear. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-206",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.2.3. Hearing protection, if required ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-207",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.2.4. Warning triangles, if required. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-208",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.2.5. First aid kit, if required. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-209",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.4.2.6. Fire extinguisher. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-210",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.5. Driving Safety and Precautions. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-211",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.5.1. Full-size van (SUV, etc.) safety and operator maintenance.  Ensure trainee understands  the importance of these safety items and procedures. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-212",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.5.1.1. Never exceed the maximum allowance of passengers. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-213",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.5.1.2. Properly load passengers and cargo.  Avoid placing any cargo on top of the roof.   Do not load passengers and cargo to one side.  Ensure the combined weight of the  occupants and cargo does not exceed the capacity listed in the operator’s manual. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-214",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.5.1.3. Be aware when driving under low hanging objects such as parking garages for  clearance of the full-size van’s roof. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-215",
          "pageNumber": 11,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.5.1.4. If a tire blow out does occur, remain calm and hold the steering wheel firmly while  letting the foot off of the accelerator.  Try to reduce the vehicle’s speed safely.  Pull the  vehicle to the side of the road onto the shoulder. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
      "pageNumber": 11,
