    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-250",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.1.4. All operators are expected to observe posted speed limits, use proper load  distribution, check tire tread/inflation, and abstain from alcohol use while operating all  vehicles. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-251",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.1.5. Vehicles with high gross weight/high center of balance such as; full-size vans,  28/44 passenger buses, wreckers, and 7 ½ ton tractors and higher, are at especially high  risk of a vehicle rollover accident. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-252",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2. Rollover prevention: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-253",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.1. Always use proper engine speed and gear ratio. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-254",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.2. Never exceed load or passenger limit. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-255",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.3. One person per seatbelt. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-256",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.4. Avoid excessive speed on curves. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-257",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.5. Adjust the driving to meet road and weather conditions. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-258",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.6. Always inspect the vehicle before-, during- and after-operation. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-259",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.7. Ensure all tires are properly inflated and in good operating condition. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-260",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.6.2.8. Avoid lateral shifts that can create a higher risk of rollovers.  Lane changes should  be smooth with clearance ahead of the vehicle and behind the vehicle. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-261",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7. Vehicle Operation. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-262",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.1. Steering. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-263",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.1.1. Keep proper hand positions on the steering wheel. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-264",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.1.2. A more than normal turn may be necessary due to the length of the vehicle. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-265",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.2. Turning. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-266",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.2.1. Check traffic to the front, rear, and sides. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-267",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.2.2. Check all mirrors, especially on the side next to the lane the vehicle is moving  into. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-268",
          "pageNumber": 14,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.2.3. Check blind spots.  Turn the head to check for blind spots for vehicles or  pedestrians.  Full-Size vans sit up higher than most sedans. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
      "pageNumber": 14,
