    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-269",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.3. Braking. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-270",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.3.1. Normal stopping is affected by:  Speed, reaction time, inclement weather,  condition of tires and brakes, type and condition of road surface and the weight of the full- size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-271",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.4. Backing. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-272",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.4.1. Use a spotter.  The operator must keep visual contact with the spotter at all times.   If visual contact is lost, the operator must immediately stop the vehicle. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-273",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.4.2. Check clearance, traffic movement, and surroundings. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-274",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.4.3. Sound horn to ensure spotter is in position and use mirrors while backing. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-275",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.4.4. Back slowly. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-276",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.4.5. See AFMAN 24-306 for additional spotter safety guidance and standard AF  spotter hand signals. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-277",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.5. Transporting passengers. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-278",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.5.1. Ensure the full-size van is in safe working condition. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-279",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.5.2. Exact number of serviceable seatbelts for passengers. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-280",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.5.3. Allow for curbside loading. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-281",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "5.7.5.4. Unload passengers with caution (on curbside, if possible).  Use hazard lights. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "h-6",
          "level": 1,
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Section 6—EXPLANATION AND DEMONSTRATION ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "heading",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-282",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.1. Instructor’s Preparation. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-283",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.1.1. Establish a training location. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-284",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.1.2. Obtain appropriate Manufacturer’s Operator’s Manual. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-285",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.1.3. Schedule/reserve a vehicle. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-286",
          "pageNumber": 15,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.1.4. Ensure trainee completes AF Form 171. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
