    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-287",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2. Safety Procedures and Equipment. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-288",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1. The following safety items should be followed by both the instructor and trainee. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-289",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.1. Chock wheel (if required) when full-size van is parked. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-290",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.2. Remove all jewelry and identification tags. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-291",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.3. Personal protective equipment and equipment items. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-292",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.3.1.   Reflective belt will be worn during hours of dark and on the flightline. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-293",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.4. The trainer should walk around vehicle to familiarize themselves and the trainee  with all warning labels and signs. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-294",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.5. Ensure trainee wears seat belt. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-295",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.6. Properly adjust driver’s seat and all mirrors, if available. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-296",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.7. Throughout demonstration, practice full-size van safety: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-297",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.7.1.   Always observe speed and safety precautions while carrying loads. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-298",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.7.2.   Keep loads within the rated capacity of the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-299",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.7.3.   Conduct passenger loading/unloading from the curbside to the maximum  extent possible. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-300",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.1.7.4.   Always check the rear before backing. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-301",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.2. Practice basic AF RM process during demonstration: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-302",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.2.1. Identify hazards. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-303",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.2.2. Assess hazards. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-304",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.2.3. Develop controls and make decisions. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-305",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.2.4. Implement controls. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-306",
          "pageNumber": 16,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.2.2.5. Supervise and evaluate. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
