    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-307",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.3. Operator Maintenance Demonstration. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-308",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.3.1. With trainee, accomplish vehicle inspection using AF Form 1800.  The vehicle  inspection will follow the seven-step method as described in Attachment 4.  An inspection  guide (Attachment 2) can be used to ensure all areas of the full-size van are covered in addition  to the “Operation Demonstration” guidelines provided below. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-309",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4. Operation Demonstration. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-310",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.1. Throughout demonstration: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-311",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.1.1. Allow for questions. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-312",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.1.2. Repeat demonstrations as needed. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-313",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.1.3. For more information refer to the vehicle data plate and the operator’s  manufacturer’s manual. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-314",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2. For all full-size vans (SUVs, etc.) within the training area, demonstrate and explain the  following.  Note:  Use information contained on the data plate and/or the operator’s manual: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-315",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.1. Go over the capacities of the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-316",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.2. Go over the full-size van, controls and warning lights. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-317",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.3. Explain parking brake as they apply to full-size van being used. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-318",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.4. Demonstrate steering. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-319",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.5. Demonstrate turning. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-320",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.6. Demonstrate changing lanes. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-321",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.7. Demonstrate entering and exiting highways. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-322",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.8. Demonstrate loading and unloading the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-323",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.9. Demonstrate backing. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-324",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.9.1.   Go over hand signals, have trainee serve as the spotter.  Keep a spotter in  sight at all times.  Explain and demonstrate how to back the full-size van without a  spotter.  Refer to AFMAN 24-306 for standard spotting signals. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-325",
          "pageNumber": 17,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.2.9.1.1.  Approach slowly. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
