    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-326",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3. Show trainee the after operation inspection and report. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-327",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.1. Ensure vehicle cleaned. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-328",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.2. Refueled. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-329",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.3. Following manufacturer’s shut-down procedures. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-330",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.4. Park. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-331",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.4.1.   Level area. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-332",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.4.2.   Place transmission control in neutral. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-333",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.4.3.   Apply the parking brake (adjust if necessary). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-334",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.5. Perform a walk-around inspection. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-335",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.3.6. Annotate any discrepancies found on AF Form 1800. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-336",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "6.4.4. Conclude by allowing time for questions and any requested re-demonstrations. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "h-7",
          "level": 1,
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Section 7—TRAINEE PERFORMANCE AND EVALUATION ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "heading",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-337",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1. Trainee Performance. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-338",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1. Instructor will: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-339",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.1. Ensure safety at all times.  Note:  Stop training when safety items are violated.   Proceed only when the trainee fully understands how to avoid repeating the safety  infraction(s). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-340",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.1.1.   Chock wheel (if required) when full-size van is parked. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-341",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.1.2.   Remove all jewelry and identification tags. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-342",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Note:  If available, mark vehicle with magnetic sign indicating “Driver in Training” or “Trainee  Operator”. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-343",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.2. Personal protective equipment and other items. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-344",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.2.1.   Reflective belt/vest during low visibility times. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-345",
          "pageNumber": 18,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.2.2.   Hearing protection, if required. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
