    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-346",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.3. Pay particular attention to the cautions and warnings listed in the operator's  manual. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-347",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.4. Ensure trainee wears seat belt. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-348",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.5. Properly adjust driver’s seat and all mirror. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-349",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.6. Full-Size van safety items/procedures. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-350",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.7. Ensure the operator is aware of driving situations he/she is to perform. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-351",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.1.8. Conduct during/after-action reviews with the trainee (demonstration may need to  be re-accomplished). ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-352",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2. Trainee performance: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-353",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.1. Conduct operator maintenance (have trainee explain items being inspected).   Note:  Allow trainee to use Attachment 2 as a guide while performing inspection. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-354",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.1.1.   Pre-inspection. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-355",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.1.2.   During inspection. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-356",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.2. Ensure AF From 1800 is properly documented. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-357",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.2.1.   Establish a road course with turns and stops signs. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-358",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.2.2.   Backing.  Serve as the trainee’s spotter, or if available, have another trainee  be the spotter. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-359",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.2.3.   Continue until trainee can show proficiency in operating. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-360",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3. Have trainee practice the following full-size van operations (use spotter when  backing) until they can safely and efficiently perform: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-361",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.1.   Operate full-size van forward and backward.  Continue until trainee can  show proficiency in operating. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-362",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.2.   Explain the capacities of the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-363",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.3.   Explain the full-size van controls and warning lights. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-364",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.4.   Explain parking brake as they apply to full-size van being used. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-365",
          "pageNumber": 19,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.5.   Demonstrate steering. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
