    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "p-366",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.6.   Demonstrate turning. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-367",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.7.   Demonstrate changing lanes. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-368",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.8.   Demonstrate entering and exiting highways. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-369",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.9.   Demonstrate loading and unloading the full-size van. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-370",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.10.  Demonstrate backing. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-371",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.10.1. Go over hand signals, have trainee serve as the spotter.  Keep a spotter  in sight at all times.  Explain and demonstrate how to back the full-size van without  a spotter. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-372",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.1.2.3.10.2. Approach slowly. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-373",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2. Performance Evaluation. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-374",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.1. Trainee will perform performance evaluation found in Attachment 3. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-375",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.1.1. Instructor and trainee will review Attachment 3. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-376",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.1.2. Instructor will answer trainee’s questions. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-377",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Note:  If available, mark vehicle with magnetic sign indicating “Driver-in-Training” or “Trainee  Operator”. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-378",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2. Instructor will: ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-379",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.1. Ensure safety at all times. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-380",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.1.1.   Place wheel chocks (if required) when full-size van is parked. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-381",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.1.2.   Remove all jewelry and identification tags. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-382",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.2. Personal protective equipment and other items. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-383",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.3. Pay particular attention to the cautions and warnings listed in the operator's  manual. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-384",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.4. Ensure trainee wears seat belt. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-385",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.5. Properly adjust driver’s seat and all mirrors. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "id": "p-386",
          "pageNumber": 20,
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "7.2.2.6. Full-Size van safety items/procedures. ",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
