                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-31",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-32",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-533",
                      "pageNumber": 28,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "2.2. Turns- Checks traffic in all  directions; uses turn signals and safely  gets into the lane needed for the turn;  slows down smoothly, checks mirrors  to ensure proper clearance; vehicle  should not move into oncoming  traffic. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-21",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-33",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-34",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-534",
                      "pageNumber": 28,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "2.3. Intersections- Checks traffic in all  directions; decelerates gently, brakes  smoothly and, if necessary; comes to a  complete stop behind any stop signs,  signals, sidewalks, or stop lines. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-22",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-35",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-36",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 28,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
          ],
          "type": "table",
        },
      ],
      "height": 792,
      "pageNumber": 28,
      "warnings": [],
      "width": 612,
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "table-3",
          "pageNumber": 29,
          "rows": [
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-535",
                      "pageNumber": 29,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "2.4. Urban/Rural Straight- Makes  regular traffic checks and maintains a  safe following distance; makes  necessary traffic checks, uses proper  signals, safely and smoothly changes  lanes. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-23",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 29,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-24",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 29,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-25",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 29,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-26",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 29,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-536",
                      "pageNumber": 29,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "2.5. Expressway- Checks traffic, uses  proper signals; merges smoothly into  the proper lane of traffic; maintains  proper lane positioning, vehicle  spacing, and vehicle speed; continue  to check traffic thoroughly in all  directions; exits using proper signals,  decelerates smoothly. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-27",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 29,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-37",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 29,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-38",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 29,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
