                      "id": "p-546",
                      "pageNumber": 29,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Understands how overloading can  affect the handling. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "p-547",
                      "pageNumber": 29,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Understands gross vehicle weight  (GVW). ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "p-548",
                      "pageNumber": 29,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Understands weight balance. ",
