                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-343",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Commander’s Fall Protection Policy Letter current? ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-23",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-21",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-344",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Commander’s appointment letter contains the following: Written documentation for  who is identified as a trainer, administrator, competent, and/or qualified personnel  whether they are within the organization or a contractor. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-24",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-22",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-345",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Written fall protection training (how do they train and evaluated their personnel?)  Training shall consist of lecture, demonstration, and hands-on application. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-25",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-23",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-346",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "If personal fall arrest systems are selected, the calculation of all clearances will be  included in the written fall protection procedures. ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-26",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-24",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-347",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Manufacturer’s Instructions for all equipment being utilized ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-27",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-25",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-348",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Written fall protection and Rescue procedures ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-28",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-26",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-349",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Fall protection self-assessment reviewed by the Commander ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-29",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-27",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-350",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Supervisor, who is a competent person, conduct, and document quarterly inspections of  all organizational fall protection equipment ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-30",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-28",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-351",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Training documentation reflecting member roles and responsibilities for their unit’s fall  protection program ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-31",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "td-29",
                  "isHeader": false,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-352",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Notes/Comments: ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-32",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
              ],
            },
            {
              "cells": [
                {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "id": "p-353",
                      "pageNumber": 17,
                      "text": [
                        {
                          "text": "Certifier/Signature:  ",
                        },
                      ],
                      "type": "paragraph",
                    },
                  ],
                  "colSpan": 1,
                  "id": "th-33",
                  "isHeader": true,
                  "pageNumber": 17,
                  "rowSpan": 1,
                },
                {
                  "blocks": [
